  "summary_en": "US Export Administration Regulations Part 742 setting license requirements and policies for Commerce Control List items by control reason: chemical/biological, nuclear, national security, missile technology, regional stability, crime control and anti-terrorism. Includes controls on advanced AI chips, semiconductor equipment and AI model weights (ECCN 4E091); UAV missile-range thresholds are marginal to embodied AI.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
