   "Section 742.6(a)(13) requires licenses for AI model weights (ECCN 4E091) worldwide, with presumption of denial for end users outside listed countries",
   "Advanced computing chips subject to country TPP allocations and presumption of denial to D:5/Macau",
   "Missile technology controls cover UAVs capable of 500 kg payload over 300 km",
   "Heightened controls and denial policy for China, Russia, Belarus, and terrorism-supporting states"
